  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Free-drifting Sediment Trap Array (FDSTAr) at Station Papa, 1998-present",
  "description": "Data from free-drifting sediment traps deployed at Ocean Station Papa, for short periods of time, three times per year, 19xx to 2000 (continuing)\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Quantity and composition of particle flux from upper layers of open ocean.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Custodian will be leaving soon and has a large quantity of data not secured in a regional data centre. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Long term time series (more than 10 years) Impact of Loss: High Recommended Action: Obtain access to the data bring to archives.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23570692",
