  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: For C:N, biogenic silicate, CaCO3: subsamples of a sample collected at station papa (a historical sample) are analyzed with each set of data to check for continuity. Zooplankton that may have swum into the trap are removed by hand. Silicate concentrations are compared to prepared standards.\n\nCompleteness: Dataset Complications: Some gaps in the data due to trap malfunction.\n\nProcessing step (1998): IOS and UBC collaborative project",
